  Comments: "This shows how multiple tracks can be imported at once from a midi file.
    In this case the file was created with Reason, though any DAW that exports binary
    midi files can be used. \n\nIMPORTANT: Make sure to name the midi file with the
    extension .bytes otherwise Unity will treat it as text and the file will be unreadable. "
